<title>PHILIPPINES: Piltel says downgrades 1996 net by 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Piltel says downgrades 1996 net by 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilipino Telephone Corp said on Monday it downgraded by 10 percent its earlier net income forecast of 1.16 billion pesos for 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;With aggregate opportunity losses due to illegal calls estimated at 300 million pesos by year-end, the company is reducing its end 1996 net income forecast by 10 percent,&quot; Piltel chief financial officer Ignatius Yenko said in a statement.</p>
</text>
